meta {
  name: HoldController
  seq: 9
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
    POST  /holds   any signed-in user
    GET   /holds   librarian, admin

  `getHolds` returns the queue for the whole school, hence staff only.

  Know before testing `createHold` as a student: the `userId` in the body is still
  trusted, so a student can place a hold in somebody else's name. US-009 only made a
  session mandatory; deriving the user from it is access rules §4.3 and is still open
  (§7 item 2).
}
